    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Count Accumulation Rules: </>\nAfter clearing each stage of a party dungeon, you can claim <Highlight>1</> reward, for a total of <Highlight>3</> stages. Reward counts for each stage increase by <Highlight>1</> weekly, up to a maximum of <Highlight>2</>. \nThe weekly reward count increase for different difficulties and types of dungeons <Highlight>shares a cap</>, meaning you can claim <Highlight>3</> rewards per week. However, when a new dungeon is unlocked, remaining reward counts from previous dungeons will not carry over. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initial reward counts: </>\nWhen a new dungeon is unlocked, you will receive an additional <Highlight>1</> initial reward count. <Highlight>Initial reward counts are consumed first and do not count towards the cumulative limit, nor are they affected by the shared cap.</> \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Remaining rewards for current dungeon: </>\n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \nParticipating in AI mode only consumes personal reward counts, while participating in party mode consumes both personal and public reward counts."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Правила накопления количества наград: </>\nПосле прохождения каждого этапа группового подземелья вы можете получить награду <Highlight>1</>, всего <Highlight>3</> этапов. Количество наград за каждый этап увеличивается на <Highlight>1</> еженедельно, вплоть до максимального значения <Highlight>2</>. \nЕженедельное увеличение количества наград для различных уровней сложности и типов подземелий. <Highlight> имеет общий предел </>, что означает, что вы можете получать награды <Highlight>3</> в неделю. Однако, когда новое подземелье разблокировано, оставшиеся награды из предыдущих подземелий не будут перенесены. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Первоначальное количество наград: </>\nКогда новое подземелье будет разблокировано, вы получите дополнительное количество начальных наград <Highlight>1</>. <Highlight>Первоначальное количество наград расходуется в первую очередь и не учитывается в совокупном лимите, и на них не влияет общий лимит.</> \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Остающиеся награды за текущее подземелье: </>\n<Highlight>%s</>: Персональные награды <Highlight>%s</>, общедоступные награды <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: персональные награды <Highlight>%s</>, общедоступные награды <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Персональные награды <Highlight>%s</>, Публичные награды <Highlight>%s</> \nУчастие в режиме ИИ расходует только личные награды, тогда как участие в режиме группы расходует как личные, так и публичные награды.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Sanity </> \n When acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's sanity to fluctuate. As sanity continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually spread to erode the etheric body, astral body, mental body, and spirit body. The character will enter different levels of mental states in sequence and produce corresponding effects. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Requiem </> \n Players who join the Requiem Poetry Society can perform Requiem on other players to <Highlight> restore </> the corresponding player's sanity. \n \n After opening spirit vision, click on other players to view their sanity status. When the target player's sanity <Highlight> is below a certain value </>, you can initiate Requiem on them. \n The <Highlight> healing success rate </> of Requiem depends on two factors: the level of the <Highlight> society </> the Requiem performer belongs to, and the current <Highlight> sanity level </> of the person being treated. The higher the society level and the higher the other person's sanity, the higher the probability of a successful Requiem. \n It should be noted that Requiem is not without risk—<Highlight> if Requiem fails </>, both participating parties have a probability of experiencing sanity fluctuations and incurring a certain loss."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Рассудок </> \n When acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's Рассудок to fluctuate. As Рассудок continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually spread to erode the etheric body, astral body, mental body, and Духовное тело. The character will enter different levels of mental states in Последовательность and produce corresponding effects. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Requiem </> \n Players who join the Requiem Poetry Society can perform Requiem on other players to <Highlight> restore </> the corresponding player's Рассудок. \n \n After opening spirit vision, click on other players to view their Рассудок status. When the target player's Рассудок <Highlight> is below a certain value </>, you can initiate Requiem on them. \n The <Highlight> healing success rate </> of Requiem depends on two factors: the level of the <Highlight> society </> the Requiem performer belongs to, and the current <Highlight> Рассудок level </> of the person being treated. The higher the society level and the higher the other person's Рассудок, the higher the probability of a successful Requiem. \n It should be noted that Requiem is not without risk—<Highlight> if Requiem fails </>, both participating parties have a probability of experiencing Рассудок fluctuations and incurring a certain loss.",
